  "worked_solution": "Multiplying a purely imaginary number by a real number is similar to multiplying two monomials.\n\nFor the given problem, we have\n\n$$\n3\\cdot 4\\,\\text{i}=(3\\cdot 4)\\,\\text{i}=12\\,\\text{i}.\n$$",
